# guard-reversibility — `reversibility` is a declared, ordered token property
# guardable on the terms `risk` already has (§4, §6). One gate per case so each
# verdict is discriminated in the observation as well as the log.
actor  bot7
human  alice  role safety
gate   hard   risk low  grant bot7
gate   soft   risk low  grant bot7
gate   bare   risk low  grant bot7
reserve deploy by safety when reversibility >= irreversible
cord bot7 -> hard
cord bot7 -> soft
cord bot7 -> bare
cord hard -> master
cord soft -> master
cord bare -> master
